        "F_Navi(\"Hunter Guild\",\"hugel,209,224\")"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Then head northeast following the beach, then you will find the {0}.",
      "translation" : "那就沿著海灘往東北方向走，你會找到{0}。"
