    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "They have put some kind of sign in the middle of village, so I guess that they are hiring people for something...",
      "translation" : "他們在村子中央立了個牌子，所以我猜他們在招人做什麼事..."
